        "username": "The_Justifier",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/{size}/4954_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-05-21T17:14:21.354Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I suppose this explains why the Tactics forum was locked after I posted in it.  This is the first I’m hearing about Tactics (aka Prime War, although I had never heard about that rebranding before joining this forum) having officially ended; I just thought it was kind of floundering out there somewhere.  Too bad, but not that surprising.</p>\n<p>Maybe someone in the community can use the RPG’s rules, but ignore its version of the timeline, and put together a fan product that fleshes out the Tactics/Prime War version of the future for RPG use.  There’s something to be said for the darker “heroes hunted” scenario, and certainly I want the chance to fight Hippocalypse someday.</p>",
        "post_number": 73,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-05-21T17:14:21.354Z",
